\"false\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>500</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>K</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100.</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Then, by dividing the result of the first condition by the result of the second, we can solve for <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"205\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D458 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>:</mo></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"206\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 9.336em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D452 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-texa